{"title":"어떤 마술의 금서목록","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=71lZV/hzXavnAqTt/X5XKBUxaMoAPTzMJc8BmAK&filename=th3","synopsis":"초능력이 일반 과학처럼 인지된 안티 오컬트의 학원도시에서 초능력은 레벨0에 불과하지만 모든 초능력을 무효화시키는 오른팔, 이매진 브레이커를 가진 불운의 사나이 카미조 앞에 한 수녀복 차림의 소녀가 하늘에서 떨어진다. \n그녀의 이름은 인덱스. 10만 3천권의 마도서를 머릿속에 담고 있는 완전기억 능력자지만, 1년에 한 번씩 마도서를 제외한 모든 생활의 기억을 리셋해야 하는 불행한 소녀 인덱스와 카미조의 액션 판타지가 펼쳐진다.\n(원작 : Kazuma Kamachi)\nⓒChuya Kogino/SQUARE ENIX CO., LTD.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":262,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":261,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":277,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":288,"change":{"type":"down","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":253,"change":{"type":"up","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":273,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":263,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":255,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":248,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":248,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":256,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":197,"change":{"type":"up","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":229,"change":{"type":"down","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":219,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":237,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":134,"change":{"type":"up","amount":103}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":191,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":225,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":267,"change":{"type":"down","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":252,"change":{"type":"up","amou